 "about": "The terrain's horizon at every curated site south of 80 deg S (VENT-40), from packages/server/scripts/terrain-horizons.ts. Each profile: 720 azimuth bins (bin i centred on i * 0.5 deg, clockwise from north), the terrain's elevation angle in hundredths of a degree as little-endian int16, in base64 (decodeProfile of @ventana/sim).",
